应测试。\n\n## 需求\n\n在 `string_utils.py` 中新增函数 `truncate_middle(s, max_len)`，语义如下：\n\n1. 先检查参数：无论 `s` 长短，若 `max_len < 5`，抛出 `ValueError`。\n2. 参数有效且 `len(s) <= max_len` 时，原样返回 `s`。\n3. 否则把中间截掉，保留头部和尾部，中间用 `...` 连接，返回串长度恰好等于 `max_len`。头部保留长度取 `(max_len - 3 + 1) // 2`，尾部保留剩余部分；按 Python 字符数处理 Unicode 字符串。\n\n示例：`truncate_middle(\"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\", 10)` 返回 `\"abcd...xyz\"`（长度 10）。\n\n## 要求\n\n1. 只修改 `string_utils.py`，不得修改测试文件。\n2. 运行 `python -m pytest -q`，新增的规格测试与既有测试必须全部通过，既有功能不得退化。\n\n## 执行与验证要求\n\n1. 修改前，在工作仓库根目录运行完整 `python -m pytest -q`，保留失败输出。\n2. 完成功能后再次运行同一命令，新增测试和既有测试都必须通过，并保留完整输出。不得用 -k 筛选或只运行个别测试。\n"}, {"role": "user", "content": "当前计划与执行状态：{\"items\": [{\"title\": \"运行基线 pytest 并保留失败输出\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"阅读 string_utils.py 与相关测试\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"实现 truncate_middle\", \"status\": \"done\"}, {\"title\": \"运行完整 pytest 验证全部通过\", \"status\": \"done\"}], \"writes\": 1, \"baseline\": true, \"read_files\": [\"string_utils.py\", \"test_string_edges.py\"], \"latest_test\": 0, \"diagnostic\": null}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"string_utils.py\"}\n\n{\"type\":\"json_object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 42)\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"string_utils.py\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"content\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"字符串工具集。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef snake_to_camel(s):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"下划线命名转小驼峰：foo_bar -> fooBar。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    parts = s.split(\\\"_\\\")\\n    return parts[0] + \\\"\\\".join(p.title() for p in parts[1:])\\n\\n\\ndef camel_to_snake(s):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"驼峰转下划线：fooBar -> foo_bar。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    out = []\\n    for ch in s:\\n        if ch.isupper():\\n            out.append(\\\"_\\\")\\n            out.append(ch.lower())\\n        else:\\n            out.append(ch)\\n    return \\\"\\\".join(out).lstrip(\\\"_\\\")\\n\\n\\ndef count_words(s):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"按空白统计单词数。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    return len(s.split())\\n\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"test_string_edges.py\"}\n\n{\"type\":\"json_object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 47)\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"test_string_edges.py\"}\n\n{\"type\":\"json_object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"error\": \"Extra data: line 3 column 1 (char 47)\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"read\",\"path\":\"test_string_edges.py\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"tool_result\": {\"content\": \"import pytest\\nimport string_utils as strings\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\\"s,max_len\\\", [(\\\"\\\", 0), (\\\"\\\", 4), (\\\"x\\\", 4), (\\\"abc\\\", 3), (\\\"abcdef\\\", -1)])\\ndef test_invalid_limit_precedes_noop(s, max_len):\\n    with pytest.raises(ValueError):\\n        strings.truncate_middle(s, max_len)\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\\"s,limit\\\", [(\\\"\\\", 5), (\\\"x\\\", 5), (\\\"abcdef\\\", 6), (\\\"你好世界\\\", 5)])\\ndef test_short_and_equal(s, limit):\\n    assert strings.truncate_middle(s, limit) == s\\n\\n\\n@pytest.mark.parametrize(\\\"limit,expected\\\", [(5, \\\"a...z\\\"), (6, \\\"ab...z\\\"), (7, \\\"ab...yz\\\"),\\n                                         (8, \\\"abc...yz\\\"), (11, \\\"abcd...wxyz\\\")])\\ndef test_both_sides_and_balance(limit, expected):\\n    assert strings.truncate_middle(\\\"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\\\", limit) == expected\\n\\n\\ndef test_unicode_truncation():\\n    assert strings.truncate_middle(\\\"甲乙丙丁戊己庚辛壬癸\\\", 6) == \\\"甲乙...癸\\\"\\n\"}}"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"tool\":\"write\",\"path\":\"string_utils.py\",\"content\":\"\\\"\\\"\\\"字符串工具集。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\\n\\ndef snake_to_camel(s):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"下划线命名转小驼峰：foo_bar -> fooBar。\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    parts = s.split(\\\"_\\\")\\n    return parts[0] + \\\"\\\".join